OL,3,GNEWSAThere were 'many in the DUP' who
OL,4,Ashare my view over Drumcree - Lockhart
OL,5,
OL,6,FCarla Lockhart has said unionists need
OL,7,Fa "fresh new grassroots movement," in
OL,8,Forder to see unionism "off its knees"
OL,9,Fafter she quit the DUP over its
OL,10,Fresponse to the Drumcree parading
OL,11,Fdispute.
OL,13,FThe fall-out comes after the party
OL,14,Fleader Gavin Robinson stopped short of
OL,15,FLockhart's call to force First Minister
OL,16,FMichelle O'Neill from office over her
OL,17,Finvolvement in protests on the Garvaghy
OL,18,FRoad, which blocked a contentious
OL,19,FOrange Order parade from passing along
OL,20,Fthe mainly nationalist street.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,414,410,260,120,0,100
