OL,3,GNEWSAThere were 'many in the DUP' who
OL,4,Ashare my view over Drumcree - Lockhart
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Upper Bann MP then left the party
OL,7,Fon a "point of principle".
OL,9,FLockhart said there were many within
OL,10,Fthe DUP who "share my view with regards
OL,11,Fto the need for profound consequences"
OL,12,Fover Drumcree.
